### Run artefacts, by the name the code gives them ###
# BaseTrainer.write_checkpoint / _render_loop_xml and friends name these after
# the run label, so listing them one path at a time misses every new label.
train_state_*.pkl
chkpoint_*.xml
*_best.xml
*learning_curve.png
sample_*.png
validation_*.png
xmlfiles/
xtcfiles/
mdlogs/
# MDAnalysis caches the frame offsets of a trajectory next to it
*_offsets.npz
*_offsets.lock

### Agent working files ###
# Claude Code keeps its plans and session state here; CLAUDE.md at the root is
# the part of it that is checked in.
/.claude/

### Run artefacts dropped in the repository root ###
# These names also belong to committed fixtures under tests/data/ and
